		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050110"},
		line=661,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"A familiar rectangular tray is unceremoniously shoved through the grate in my cell door.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Same as usual...)”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"A single cup of rice gruel with a few scant scraps of vegetables.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Naturally, the taste isn't even worth mentioning.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"I silently bring the crude wooden spoon to my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The handcuffs binding my wrists hardly bother me at this point.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"It's hard to tell the exact date due to the lack of windows, but judging by the number of meals I've been served, it must be December by now.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Nearly four months have passed since our failed uprising.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Is Soujin still alive...?)”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"After parting ways with Soujin─",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"I was summarily dispatched in my duel with Father.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Our battle was decided in just a handful of blows.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"I passed out from blood loss, and when I next awakened, I found myself imprisoned in this cell.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(I'd thought myself a worthy match, but it seems I still have much to learn.)”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Placing down my empty bowl, I return the tray to its sender.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh, done already?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The heavy door of steel swings open, revealing the source of the voice.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"She's wearing a Republican Army uniform, but her features are strikingly Imperial.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“This would be our first time meeting face-to-face.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you an Imperial?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That's right. The name's Yagi Sekka.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The woman named Sekka crawls her smirking gaze all over my body.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's an Imperial doing, supporting the Republic?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That doesn't concern you.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“More importantly, how do you find the food? I instructed them to prepare it to Imperial tastes.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Send my regards to the chef.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Heheheh... kept up a good sense of humor even after so long in solitary, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The woman smirks derisively.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't afford to die just yet.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Still holding out hope of seeing Tokita Soujin again?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"My heart twinges uncontrollably upon hearing Soujin's name.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh my, still obsessed with that man, are we?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Was attacking Miyaguni not enough for you?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"That's right... I've heard this woman's voice before.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"It's the same voice I heard when I was possessed by that spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...You were the one controlling that spellblade?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That's right, my dear little Inou-san.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'll have you know, you gave me quite the fright back then.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I mean, you nearly up and killed Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wasn't that your intention all along?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But whatever, that's all in the past.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"She completely ignores me.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So you can use magicks, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Quite a bit better than your average magicker, even.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“After all, I used to be a priestess at Her Majesty's service.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why would you betray the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I came to meet someone in the Republican Army who appreciated my talents more.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Governor-General Warren also happens to think rather highly of me, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The greatest threat the Empire posed was always its magicks, not to mention the spellblades created from it and the warriors who wield them.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And I found my calling as someone capable of neutralizing that threat.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"She sneers at me with a gaze filled with contemptuous superiority.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In that case, the Artifact that paralyzed us in the palace courtyard...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Was my creation, yes.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You killed my comrades!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I lunge at her with cuffed hands.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Gaaah?!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Only to be flung away, as though hitting an invisible wall.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What? Magicks...?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Told you I was on a different level than ordinary priestesses, didn't I?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're nothing but a traitor.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“A traitor, am I? I'll have you know I never once owed the Empire a single shred of loyalty.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Honestly, I wish the governor-general would just burn this whole country to the ground.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You dare...”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"How dare a priestess─a faithful servant of the Empire─ever say such things?!",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"But my indignation chokes the words in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, the governor-general's obsessed with this idea of... what was it? Sustainable development?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And that apparently involves using you as slaves instead of killing you.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We Imperials will never be your slaves.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That so?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Your father certainly doesn't have the same objections.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“He follows my every order like a mindless dog.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I see. So it was you...”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"It was ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"her",
{"/font"},
" magicks which reduced Father to... that puppet...",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I raise my fists, handcuffs and all, lunging at this woman once again.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"The invisible wall repels me.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You damn coward!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Curse you!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Give him back!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Give him back!",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Over and over, I throw myself at the invisible wall with all my strength.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"The handcuffs tear into my wrists, spattering the walls with my blood.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That's enough.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aaaaaaahhhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"An excruciating shock races through my body.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"My vision flickers black, and my ears are left ringing.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ugh... ghhh...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"My nostrils fill with the smell of scorched flesh rising from my own body.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I collapse against the nearest wall, barely managing to keep myself standing.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What did you do... to my father?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Just a little training is all.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Whenever he doesn't do as I say, he gets a few new boo-boos.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You'll be getting the same treatment soon. Do look forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...You damn bootlicker.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right. While we're at it, why don't you take this chance to pay respect to your elders?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"With a vulgar smile, she turns to look out the door.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Kokuan-chan, come on in!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Please, no...",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Don't listen to her.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"I don't want to see you like this, a thrall to this woman's bidding.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"But─",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“F-Father...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"He has nothing even resembling an expression on his face.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Naturally, there's no sign that he recognizes his own daughter standing before him.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"His lifeless eyes merely stare straight ahead, no different from those of a puppet.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Father was well prepared to meet his end when he was captured by the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"But he was denied a good death, and instead, forcibly kept alive as a mindless puppet─",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Such a dishonorable fate is far worse than any death.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yagi Sekka, I will see you dead if it's the last thing I do.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ooh, how scary.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But you have nothing to worry about. You'll be standing at your father's side soon enough.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Won't that be nice? You'll be able to get in plenty of father-daughter bonding hunting down Tokita together!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hahaha, ahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The woman cackles maniacally.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"But her grating laughter only serves to cool my own head.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's just sad, seeing you hide your inner weakness behind all that bluster.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suggest you not disgrace yourself any further.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The woman returns me a sharp and spiteful gaze.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“That's the spirit, Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"The invisible wall separating the two of us vanishes into thin wisps of light.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kh?!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"The next moment, my arms are forcibly yanked above my head.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"This must be her magicks at work.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I struggle desperately against the invisible force, but my toes only scrabble helplessly against the floor.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Now then, how about we get started with your training?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The woman takes out a police baton.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I am the chairman of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You think that little stick will be enough?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Only one way to find out!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"The woman swings her arm down with the ferocity of a mad dog.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"One blow, and another, and another.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"A dull pain slowly spreads across my body.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"The floor is soon stained with my blood.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"This amount of pain is all in a day's training.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"It's nothing I can't handle.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"But that pair of cold, indifferent eyes piercing into me are a different story.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The baton falls down on my forehead.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Sending a spray of blood across Father's face.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Fa... ther...”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"He makes no move to even wipe the blood from his face.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Is nothing capable of reaching you anymore?)”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Your own daughter's blood? What a wonderful skin care regimen!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The woman wets her finger with the blood dripping from\nFather's face.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In that case... feel free to rub some on your own face.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Might help you work out some of those hideous wrinkles.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You've got some nerve.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Fortunately, though, I'm awfully good at holding grudges.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"She smiles sadistically, raising the baton high over her head.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"But the blow I'm bracing for never comes.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Her eyes, glazed over with vindictiveness moments prior, suddenly regain their cool calm.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“So that's where you were... Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Exalt-Priestess? Is she talking about Kotone?",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The woman whirls around, staring at the filthy, windowless cell wall.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"No, it's as if she's staring right through it, her gaze fixed on a point far away in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Did you seriously think I wouldn't notice if you cast a spell that big?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hehee... That stupid girl.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"The baton clatters down to the floor.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'll be back for ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
